# Placeholder so `//go:embed all:dist` in ../static.go always matches at least
# one file. The real frontend bundle is written into this directory by
# `go generate ./internal/static/` (which runs `pnpm run build` in
# ../../frontend) and is gitignored. This .gitkeep is NOT gitignored — see
# the `internal/static/dist/**/*` glob in the repo .gitignore, which excludes
# files INSIDE dist/ but leaves the directory (and this dotfile) tracked.
#
# Without this file, golangci-lint and any `go build` performed before
# `go generate` runs fails with:
#     pattern all:dist: no matching files found
# That breaks the standards lint-hooks workflow, which lints before any
# project-specific generate step.
